From 8601644f7c96f9bea430c43b2f45ba705e618650 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tunkoal <tunkoal@163.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:10:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] hardware: Recover display mode clients after service
 failures

Use nonblocking lookup for display profiles, invalidate the matching cached binder on death, and handle business failures without crashing clients. Do not retry setters with an unknown remote result. Reject null mode payloads instead of dereferencing them.

Source and diff checks only; compilation and service death/failure validation are deferred to the combined device candidate.

Change-Id: Ic394f5e18ebaa0fc06f6d8f2dada4a53c8fff536
---
